  "faq_notifications_question": "I'm not receiving notifications",
  "faq_notifications_answer": "To receive notifications:\n1. Go to iOS Settings > M1SSION > Notifications\n2. Enable \"Allow Notifications\"\n3. Make sure \"Do Not Disturb\" mode is off\n4. Restart the app\n\nIf the problem persists, try reinstalling the app.",
  "faq_confused_question": "I don't know what to do now",
  "faq_confused_answer": "M1SSION guides you through daily missions. To start:\n1. Check the \"Next Action\" container on Home\n2. Complete the daily commit (the 3 blobs)\n3. Explore the map to find clues\n4. Use AION for smart suggestions\n\nEvery action brings you closer to the final prize!",
  "faq_rewards_question": "M1U / Prizes",
  "faq_rewards_answer": "M1U (M1 Units) are M1SSION's currency:\n• Earn M1U by completing actions\n• Use M1U to unlock premium clues\n• You can buy M1U in the Shop\n\nPrizes are awarded to top agents on the leaderboard. Check your position in real time!",
  "faq_access_question": "Access problems",
  "faq_access_answer": "If you have trouble logging in:\n1. Check your internet connection\n2. Try logging out and back in\n3. If you forgot your password, use \"Forgot Password\"\n4. Make sure your email is correct\n\nFor persistent issues, contact AION.",
  "faq_bug_question": "Error / Bug",
  "faq_bug_answer": "If you encounter an error:\n1. Restart the app\n2. Make sure you have the latest version\n3. Clear the cache (Settings > M1SSION > Clear cache)\n\nTo report a bug, talk to AION describing the problem and when it occurs.",

